    "text": "WHSV\nwebsite\nRockingham County, Virginia\nRockingham County Board of Supervisors approves rezoning for travel center\nBy Ryan Hartnett,\n55 minutes agoHARRISONBURG, Va. (WHSV) - The Rockingham County Board of Supervisors has approved the Sunoco station located just off of I-81 at Exit 251, to be rezoned to add travel center amenities like showers at its Wednesday night meeting. The current zoning of the gas station is classified as B-1, which...",
